# Copy to .env.local and adjust. Both are optional — the defaults work against a backend on
# localhost:8080 with no configuration at all.

# Where the dev server proxies /v1 to. Read by vite.config.ts at startup.
# VITE_BACKEND_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8080

# Base URL the generated client prefixes to every request. Leave unset in dev so calls stay
# same-origin and go through the proxy above. Set it for a deployed build, where there is no
# proxy — e.g. https://api.lifetracker.example/v1
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
